                }
            },
            "rdf_types": [
                "mnemo:BlockValuation"
            ],
            "subject_rule": "graph_subject(graph_id)value/{document_id}/{block_id} — code-minted"
        }
    },
    "comment": "EA-2b SHACL retrofit contract for the Salience BlockValuation Meaningful Object. NOT a served emporium pack — an AUTHORED mirror of the code-defined salience_value_triples span, whose sole consumer is vocab_to_shacl. mnemo: is the runtime MNEMO_NS (https://mnemosyne.local/ns#); mdoc: is MDOC_NS (http://mnemosyne.dev/doc#). primary_prefix=mnemo so only mnemo:BlockValuation is a shape target (mdoc: predicates are still permitted by the closed shape).",
    "description": "Per-block valuation: a reified BlockValuation carrying cumulative importance/valence sums and counts, the targeted block, optional user overrides and tags, mirrored across the mnemo: and mdoc: namespaces.",
    "name": "emporium-salience",
